    {
        "content": "<p>Hi, when running</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Enriched</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I get</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Current</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">branch</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">enriched</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">natural</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">transformations</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Azure</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fork</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">arnoudvanderleer</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">mathlib4</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Attempting</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">download</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8250</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">leanprover</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">community</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">mathlib4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8208</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8250</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">8250</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">119</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6049</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8208</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Attempting</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">download</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">arnoudvanderleer</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">mathlib4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Downloaded</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">attempted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">87</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KB</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">39</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Decompressed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Already</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decompressed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8250</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">✖</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">452</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">479</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Building</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proofwidgets</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">widgetJsAll</span>\n<span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ProofWidgets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reuse</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">built</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">JS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Please</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">report</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">issue</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Zulip</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">required</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">targets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">logged</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failures</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proofwidgets</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">widgetJsAll</span>\n<span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failed</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>So the second step fails, and tells me to report here. So here is a report. Is there a way to fix it?<br>\nNow, when I try to \"Restart File\", it gives the same error. (Both lake build and Restart File have worked on this file before, but it seems that my lean extension downloaded a (new) version this afternoon. Not sure whether that has anything to do with it)</p>",
        "id": 584518368,
        "sender_full_name": "Arnoud van der Leer",
        "timestamp": 1775760235
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Try any one of these:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>lake build -H</code></li>\n<li><code>lake clean</code></li>\n<li><code>lake exe cache get!</code></li>\n<li><code>rm -rf .lake</code></li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 584518826,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775760419
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What is the intention with this? Are they all supposed to have the same effect?</p>",
        "id": 584518950,
        "sender_full_name": "Arnoud van der Leer",
        "timestamp": 1775760462
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I believe the first one will fix it, but these are multiple ways of convincing Lean to retry fetching stuff</p>",
        "id": 584519044,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775760502
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You are the (large number)th person to point out that things broke a bit recently: if you search for the error on this Zulip you'll find endless discussions of it and what the various fixes do. The fixes nuke the problem in various ways.</p>",
        "id": 584519283,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1775760589
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Although the error is usually <code>ProofWidgets not up-to-date</code>, strange that it's different here</p>",
        "id": 584519665,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1775760719
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh then I need to retract my claim! Apologies! But it would be interesting to know if the same fixes fix this possibly related error.</p>",
        "id": 584519810,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1775760773
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>We have recently changed how ProofWidgets is built, precisely to reduce the frequency of <code>ProofWidgets not up-to-date</code> that people encounter. That specific error will never appear again. The new one (\"failed to reuse ...\") should in theory never happen, but clearly that theory is wrong.</p>\n<p>FWIW <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"406521\">@Arnoud van der Leer</span> I am able to build a fresh checkout of your branch without issues. If you are still seeing the error, it would be helpful if you DM'd me a <code>.zip</code> of <code>.lake/packages/proofwidgets</code>; no worries if you have already fixed it, though.</p>",
        "id": 584522333,
        "sender_full_name": "𝚠𝚘𝚓𝚌𝚒𝚎𝚌𝚑 𝚗𝚊𝚠𝚛𝚘𝚌𝚔𝚒",
        "timestamp": 1775761725
    },
    {
